Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:06:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Mac Suite redesign (owner-approved): capped picture with
 takes strip, folding Setup/Inputs, settings in the bar, compact Setup row

- The picture is aspect-fit and capped at 50% of the page height, centred, with this tool's takes as a strip under it.
- The right column (280/264 pt) folds Setup and Inputs with summaries; saved rigs move to the Setup header's menu.
- Shape, Length and Takes are back in the prompt bar next to Generate (the Settings row is gone).
- Below 900 pt of composer width, or with Setup hidden from the header, the column becomes a row of buttons above the
  prompt plus an Inputs popover.
- With Claude open on the Suite the sidebar is the icon rail.
Plan and decisions: plans/studio-redesign.md; mocks: design/studio-redesign/.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Py2rxphub3JG9Gtsd3sf7U
